msgstr "Connexions"

#: ui/templates/imports/ui/index.html
msgid ""
"Connect the cloud you are leaving - a Nextcloud account or any WebDAV folder."
msgstr ""
"Connectez le cloud que vous quittez : un compte Nextcloud ou n’importe quel "
"dossier WebDAV."

